## Proposed Changes

### [src/app/components/stats-card/](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/components/stats-card/)
#### [MODIFY] [stats-card.component.ts](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/components/stats-card/stats-card.component.ts)
- Refactor inputs to match reference:
  - `title` (was label)
  - `count` (was value)
  - `iconBgColor` (class string)
