- Update icon switch to support: `chart`, `error`, `time`, `pause`, `description`.
- Use Tailwind classes for styling instead of inline styles where appropriate.

### [src/app/pages/dashboard/](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/pages/dashboard/)
#### [MODIFY] [dashboard.component.ts](file:///Users/ralein/Desktop/Project/UI/src/app/pages/dashboard/dashboard.component.ts)
